sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant I as intake (HTTP)
    participant SB1 as Service Bus<br/>topic: orders
    participant V as validation
    participant SB2 as Service Bus<br/>topic: payments
    participant P as payment
    participant SB3 as Service Bus<br/>topic: fulfilment
    participant F as fulfilment
    participant DB as Cosmos DB<br/>(orders container)
    participant DLQ as Dead-letter queue

    C->>I: POST /api/orders
    I->>DB: upsert status=received
    I->>SB1: publish order
    I-->>C: 202 Accepted

    SB1->>V: deliver (sub: validation)
    alt invalid payload
        V->>DB: upsert status=rejected (reason)
    else no orderId (malformed)
        V->>V: log + drop (not retried)
    else valid
        V->>DB: upsert status=validated
        V->>SB2: publish order
    end

    SB2->>P: deliver (sub: payment)
    alt payment authorised
        P->>DB: upsert status=paid
        P->>SB3: publish order
    else declined, attempts < 3
        P->>DB: upsert status=payment_failed
        P->>SB2: throw -> redelivered
    else declined, attempts = 3
        P->>DB: upsert status=dead_lettered
        P->>DLQ: Service Bus moves message
    end

    SB3->>F: deliver (sub: fulfilment)
    F->>DB: upsert status=fulfilled
